{"id":25,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"تَبَارَكَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى نَزَّلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْفُرْقَانَ عَلَىٰ عَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">بْ</span>دِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> لِيَكُونَ لِلْعَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>لَمِينَ نَذِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"ٱلَّذِى لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مُلْكُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَلَمْ يَتَّخِذْ وَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">دًا و</span>َلَمْ يَك<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ُن ل</span>َّهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> شَرِي<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">كٌ ف</span>ِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُلْكِ وَخَلَقَ كُلَّ ش<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">َىْءٍ ف</span>َقَدَّرَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> تَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>دِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّخَذُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>ُونِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِۦٓ</span> ءَالِهَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةً ل</span>َّا يَخْلُقُونَ شَيْـ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ـًٔا و</span>َهُمْ يُخْلَقُونَ وَلَا يَمْلِكُونَ لِأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>ُسِهِمْ ضَر<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ًّا و</span>َلَا نَفْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">عًا و</span>َلَا يَمْلِكُونَ مَوْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">تًا و</span>َلَا حَيَ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">و</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً و</span>َلَا نُشُورًا <span cla