class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لَوْلَا نُزِّلَ عَلَيْهِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرْءَانُ جُمْلَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً و</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>حِدَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ةً‌ۚ ك</span>َذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكَ لِنُثَبِّتَ بِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> فُؤَادَكَ‌ۖ وَرَتَّلْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُ تَرْتِيلاً <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٢</span>"},{"id":33,"tajweed":"وَلَا يَأْتُونَكَ بِمَثَلٍ إِلَّا جِئْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>كَ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ وَأَحْسَنَ تَفْسِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٣</span>"},{"id":34,"tajweed":"ٱلَّذِينَ يُحْشَرُونَ عَلَىٰ وُجُوهِهِمْ إِلَىٰ جَهَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َمَ أُ<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">وْ</span>لَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ـٰٓ</span>ئِكَ شَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌّ م</span>َّكَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">نًا و</span>َأَضَلُّ سَبِيلاً <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٤</span>"},{"id":35,"tajweed":"وَلَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> ءَاتَيْنَا مُوسَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بَ وَجَعَلْنَا مَعَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> أَخَاهُ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>رُونَ وَزِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٥</span>"},{"id":36,"tajweed":"فَقُلْنَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>ذْهَب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَوْمِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَذَّبُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِـَٔـايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تِنَا فَدَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َرْنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هُمْ تَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>مِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣٦</span>"},{"id":37,"tajweed":"وَقَوْمَ 