an><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ضًا ي</span>َسِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٦</span>"},{"id":47,"tajweed":"وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِى جَعَلَ لَكُمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلَ لِبَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">سًا و</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َوْمَ سُبَا<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">تًا و</span>َجَعَلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهَارَ نُشُورًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٧</span>"},{"id":48,"tajweed":"وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ِىٓ</span> أَرْسَلَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رِّيَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>حَ بُشْر<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">َۢا ب</span>َيْنَ يَدَىْ رَحْمَتِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span>‌ۚ وَأَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>َلْنَا مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِ م<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ءً ط</span>َهُورًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٨</span>"},{"id":49,"tajweed":"لِّنُحْــِۧىَ بِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> بَلْدَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً م</span>َّيْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">تًا و</span>َنُسْقِيَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا خَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>ن<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَنْعَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">مًا و</span>َأَنَاسِىَّ كَثِيرًا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤٩</span>"},{"id":50,"tajweed":"وَلَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> صَ